\quad\longrightarrow\quad
\{\text{physics},\ \text{psychiatry},\ \text{Krishnamurti's inquiry}\}.$ This is not a formula in the physical sense. It is a map of the room: several disciplined approaches to life are about to meet, and the chapter must let that meeting unfold in order.

