p.src:
We can write the danger compactly: $\text{fragmented observer}
+
\text{fragmented theory}
\not\Rightarrow
\text{freedom from fragmentation}.$ The symbol $\not\Rightarrow$ carries only its ordinary logical force: the conclusion does not follow. The lecture does not prove a theorem. It opens a problem that the later dialogues are meant to examine.

